Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.57,0:02:22.78,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HFA838E&\blur4\fad(200,200)}向前迈进 我相信这样的理想
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.09,0:02:26.18,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HDF7D3D&\blur4\fad(200,200)}必须改变心态
